                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Purpose: Annual solar irradiation in kWh/m2 over a ground surface and its surrounding facades.
Fidelity: Screening - interactive beam, sky and ground-reflected estimate, not a Radiance simulation.
Method: Brep Grid Points samples surfaces at 1 m; Sky Exposure gives sky view; Solar Irradiation sums every daylight hour of an Istanbul year.
Result: Ground and context coloured on one legend range; Text Tag prints rounded ground values.
Needs: Nothing to install; runs inside Rhino. Runtime: seconds to minutes.
Edit: Ground Brep, the ten context Breps, weather station.</item>
